<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For Busu — Happy Birthday</title>
<style>
  :root { --ink:#34312e; --muted:#817a72; --paper:#f8f6f1; --line:#e8e2d8; --accent:#9b8068; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
  .page { width:min(760px, 100% - 36px); margin:0 auto; }
  .hero { min-height:92vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:center; text-align:center; padding:70px 10px 50px; }
  .eyebrow { color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.22em; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:10px; }
  h1 { font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(48px, 10vw, 82px); line-height:1.02; margin:24px 0 18px; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .sub { color:var(--muted); font-family:Georgia,serif; font-style:italic; font-size:18px; }
  .rule { width:42px; height:1px; background:#b7a28d; margin:34px auto; }
  .scroll { margin-top:42px; color:var(--muted); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  section { padding:65px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .small-title { text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.2em; font-size:10px; color:var(--accent); text-align:center; }
  .message { max-width:560px; margin:28px auto 0; text-align:center; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(20px,4vw,25px); line-height:1.8; font-weight:400; }
  .message p { margin:0 0 20px; }
  .sign { text-align:center; margin-top:32px; color:var(--muted); font-family:Georgia,serif; font-style:italic; }
  .music { text-align:center; }
  .music p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; font-size:14px; margin:18px auto 26px; max-width:420px; }
  .video { width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; border:0; border-radius:3px; background:#e8e2d8; }
  footer { padding:30px 0 48px; text-align:center; color:#9a9288; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .fade { animation: appear 1.4s ease both; }
  @keyframes appear { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(12px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html {scroll-behavior:auto} .fade {animation:none} }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow fade">A little note for you</div>
    <h1 class="fade">Happy Birthday,<br>Busu.</h1>
    <div class="sub fade">Wishing you a day as lovely as you are.</div>
    <div class="rule fade"></div>
    <div class="eyebrow fade">Made with care</div>
    <div class="scroll">Scroll to read ↓</div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="small-title">A birthday note</div>
    <div class="message fade">
      <p>Happy birthday, Busu.</p>
      <p>I hope this new chapter brings you good things, quiet happiness, and plenty of reasons to smile.</p>
      <p>May you keep growing, discovering new things, and finding joy in the little moments. I hope life treats you kindly, today and always.</p>
      <p>Thank you for being yourself. You deserve all the good things coming your way.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sign">Wishing you the best, always.</div>
  </section>

  <section class="music">
    <div class="small-title">One last thing</div>
    <div class="message" style="font-size:22px; margin-top:18px">A song to end this little birthday note.</div>
    <p>Bruno Mars — <em>Just The Way You Are</em></p>
    <iframe class="video" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/LjhCEhWiKXk" title="Bruno Mars - Just The Way You Are (Official Music Video)" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    <p style="font-size:11px">Press play whenever you're ready.</p>
  </section>
  <footer>HAPPY BIRTHDAY · BUSU</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
